dam = d a m V2=a ok, C3=m∉{d,b,t,w}
rat = r a t V2=a, C3=t∈{d,b,t,w}
car = c a r V2=a ok, C3=r∉{d,b,t,w}
bin = b i n V2=i∉{a,u,o}, C3=n∉{d,b,t,w}
rat is the sole conformer; A,B,D,E are all non-members, leg being the canonical e-vowel / g-coda non-member parallel to ear/ego/ate.

Letter-avoidance e,m,r,p-free reading gives the same classification for leg/dam/car and makes bin the sole conformer.

A competing minimal reading isolates the two CVC counter-examples cop and mom. Ear/ego/ate force CVC, cop/mom force C3∉{m,p}. Under CVC + C3∉{m,p}: leg, rat, car, bin are admissible, dam is the unique violation, i.e. the mom-type coda failure. Colleagues 3,4,5,7 push this minimal CVC-coda reading and select B.dam as the unique non-member; colleagues 1,2,6,8 push the V2∈{a,u,o}, C3∈{b,d,t,w} reading and identify rat as the only list member and leg as the prototypical non-member.

